sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Phosphor User-Agent Conversation Flow

    participant U as User (TUI/CLI)
    participant App as App Layer
    participant Coord as Coordinator
    participant Agent as SessionAgent
    participant DB as SQLite DB
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant Tools as Tools & Hooks
    participant PubSub as Pub/Sub Events

    Note over U,PubSub: === INITIALIZATION ===
    App->>Coord: NewCoordinator(ctx)
    Coord->>Coord: Build system prompt & tools
    Coord->>Agent: NewSessionAgent(opts)
    Agent->>DB: Initialize message service

    Note over U,PubSub: === USER PROMPT INCOMING ===
    U->>App: Send prompt + sessionID
    App->>App: resolveSession() (create/continue)
    App->>Coord: Run(ctx, sessionID, prompt)

    Note over Coord,LLM: === COORDINATOR PREPARATION ===
    Coord->>Coord: UpdateModels() (refresh LLM models)
    Coord->>Coord: Merge call options (temp, topP, etc.)
    Coord->>Coord: Check OAuth token expiry
    
    alt Token expired
        Coord->>Coord: RefreshOAuth2Token()
    end

    Note over Coord,LLM: === SESSION AGENT RUN ===
    Coord->>Agent: Run(ctx, SessionAgentCall)
    
    Agent->>Agent: ValidateCall() (check prompt not empty)
    Agent->>DB: Create user message
    DB-->>Agent: User message created
    
    Agent->>Agent: preparePrompt()
    Note over Agent: - Fetch conversation history<br/>- Filter orphaned tool results<br/>- Deduplicate reasoning content<br/>- Process attachments
    
    Agent->>LLM: agent.Stream(call)
    
    Note over Agent,LLM: === STREAMING TURN ===
    
    LLM-->>Agent: PrepareStep callback
    Agent->>Agent: Create assistant message in DB
    Agent->>DB: Update assistant (empty)
    
    loop Streaming tokens
        LLM-->>Agent: OnTextDelta(text)
        Agent->>DB: Append text to assistant
        Agent->>PubSub: Publish message update
        
        alt Tool call detected
            LLM-->>Agent: OnToolCall(tc)
            Agent->>DB: Add tool call to assistant
            Agent->>Tools: Execute tool (bash/edit/view/etc.)
            Tools->>Tools: Run PreToolUse hooks
            Tools->>Tools: Check permissions
            
            alt Hook halts/perm denied
                Tools-->>Agent: StopTurn = true
            else Tool succeeds
                Tools-->>Agent: Tool result
                Agent->>DB: Create tool message
                Agent->>PubSub: Publish tool result
            end
        end
        
        alt Reasoning content
            LLM-->>Agent: OnReasoningDelta(text)
            Agent->>DB: Append reasoning to assistant
        end
    end
    
    LLM-->>Agent: OnStepFinish(stepResult)
    Agent->>DB: Mark assistant finish reason
    Agent->>DB: Update session usage (tokens, cost)
    
    Note over Agent,LLM: === POST-STREAM HANDLING ===
    
    alt Context window exceeded threshold
        Agent->>Agent: Auto-summarize
        Agent->>LLM: Summarize() with summary prompt
        LLM-->>Agent: Summary response
        Agent->>DB: Create summary message
        Note over Agent: Re-queue interrupted prompt
    end
    
    alt Reflection detected (<reflection> tags)
        Agent->>Agent: Add correction system message
        Agent->>LLM: Run() again with correction
    end
    
    alt Queued prompts exist
        Agent->>Agent: drainQueueForStep()
        Note over Agent: - Drop canceled prompts<br/>- Fold uncanceled prompts into current turn<br/>- Keep other queued prompts for next turn
    end
    
    Agent->>PubSub: Publish RunComplete event
    Agent->>App: Notify agent finished
    
    Note over U,PubSub: === RESPONSE TO USER ===
    PubSub->>U: Stream assistant text via TUI
    U-->>U: Display response

    Note over Coord,LLM: === ERROR HANDLING PATHS ===
    
    alt Unauthorized (401)
        LLM-->>Coord: ProviderError 401
        Coord->>Coord: runWithUnauthorizedRetry()
        Coord->>Coord: Refresh token & retry
    end
    
    alt Bad Request (400)
        LLM-->>Coord: ProviderError 400
        Coord->>Coord: Retry once
        alt Still 400
            Coord->>Coord: Strip last tool call
            Coord->>Coord: Inject tool observation
            Coord->>Agent: Run() with stripped context
        end
    end
    
    alt User cancel (Escape)
        U->>Agent: Cancel(sessionID)
        Agent->>Agent: Cancel active request
        Agent->>DB: Persist canceled turn
        Agent-->>Coord: Return nil, context.Canceled
    end
